    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hi, I'm a nurse manager at a hospital in Chicago. I'm putting together a training module for our new ED staff on de-escalation techniques. Can you help me outline some key verbal strategies they should use when they encounter a patient who is becoming increasingly agitated or unpredictable?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
